From: Codex release retention
Subject: [PATCH] Record final sideload stage before USERDATA format

Reason: The final split ZIP can be read from USERDATA, but the updater formats
USERDATA before the old tail records completion. Move the final-stage marker to
immediately before the unique USERDATA-format boundary; intermediate-stage
markers remain after their own payload writes. This preserves restart state
without relying on a ZIP that the final stage itself erases.

Files: scripts/internal/split_legacy_sideload.py. Verification: replay the
existing fixture/build audit for final-stage ordering and install all ZIP32
stages through RC=0, checking `next=done` and fresh USERDATA UUID. This repairs
patch replay of the already-used retention behavior; it does not change ROM
images or installer partition scope.

--- a/scripts/internal/split_legacy_sideload.py
+++ b/scripts/internal/split_legacy_sideload.py
@@ -102,15 +102,25 @@
         script += (f'block_image_update("{device}", package_extract_file("system.transfer.list"), '
                    '"system.new.dat.br", "system.patch.dat") ||\n'
                    '    abort("E1001: Failed to apply legacy system part.");\n')
+        script += (f'package_extract_file("legacy_next.prop", "{state}") ||\n'
+                   '    abort("E9810: Cannot record completed legacy part.");\n')
     else:
         script += ('package_extract_dir("exynos9810", "/tmp/exynos9810");\n'
                    'run_program("/sbin/chmod", "-R", "0755", "/tmp/exynos9810") == 0 ||\n'
                    '    abort("E9810: Cannot prepare final legacy installer.");\n'
                    'run_program("/sbin/sh", "/tmp/exynos9810/preflight.sh", "star2lte") == 0 ||\n'
-                   '    abort("E9810: Legacy final layout is not ready.");\n' + tail)
-    script += (f'package_extract_file("legacy_next.prop", "{state}") ||\n'
-               '    abort("E9810: Cannot record completed legacy part.");\n'
-               'set_progress(1.000000);\n')
+                   '    abort("E9810: Legacy final layout is not ready.");\n')
+        format_marker = 'ui_print("Formatting cache, omr, preload and data...");'
+        if tail.count(format_marker) != 1:
+            raise ValueError("Final stage must have one post-install format boundary")
+        state_write = (f'package_extract_file("legacy_next.prop", "{state}") ||\n'
+                       '    abort("E9810: Cannot record completed legacy part.");\n')
+        # The final stage ZIP can itself live on USERDATA. Record its completion
+        # state before the installer unmounts/formats USERDATA, so no later
+        # package_extract_file call needs to read from the erased filesystem.
+        before_format, after_format = tail.split(format_marker, 1)
+        script += before_format + state_write + format_marker + after_format
+    script += 'set_progress(1.000000);\n'
     if index < count:
         script += 'ui_print("Part complete. Stay in recovery and install the next numbered part.");\n'
     return script
